    <string name="DDGDisableFavoriteSearchEmojiTags">Hide favourite reactions in Saved Messages search</string>
    <string name="DDGDisableFavoriteSearchEmojiTagsInfo">Removes the row of favourite reactions above the search field, both in Saved Messages and in your profile. Reopen Saved Messages for it to take effect.</string>
    <string name="DDGDisablePremiumFavoriteEmojiTags">Hide favourite reactions in the reaction menu</string>
